~ start
Commander Hyperion: Good work, {{GameState.player_name}}. Just one more fight to go.
- Still? The news have stopped reporting on the aliens, we seem to be safe now? => question_commander
- We seem to be on the offensive, rather than the defensive, sir? => question_commander
- Of course, I am here to serve. => submissive
=> END

~ question_commander
Commander Hyperion: Are you questioning me, {{GameState.player_name}}? Or should I say, {{GameState.real_player_name}}?
- How... do you know my real name?
	Commander Hyperion: I see you, {{GameState.real_player_name}}. You will destroy all of these aliens, or you will die trying.
	- I refuse.
		do get_tree().quit()
	- Fine.
		Commander Hyperion: You're the space invader now.
- Sir, no sir.
	Commander Hyperion: Go and fight for humanity, {{GameState.real_player_name}}.
	Commander Hyperion: You're the space invader now.
=> END

~ submissive
Commander Hyperion: The end is nigh, {{GameState.player_name}}. You have done us all a good service.
Commander Hyperion: The world will remember your efforts, {{GameState.real_player_name}}.
Commander Hyperion: Good luck, space invader! Decimate all of those aliens!
=> END